  description: Ytterbium is a chemical element with symbol Yb and atomic number 70.
    It is the fourteenth and penultimate element in the lanthanide series, which
    is the basis of the relative stability of its +2 oxidation state. However, like
    the other lanthanides, its most common oxidation state is +3, seen in its oxide,
    halides and other compounds.
